 61CA c  E({+82}Se)=228 MeV/nucleon beam from the FRIB facility                 
 61CA2c   at MSU. The fragments were separated                                  
 61CA3c  and analyzed in the Advanced Rare Isotope Separator (ARIS).            
 61CA4c  Ions or fragments of interest were                                     
 61CA5c  detected in a PIN diode telescope of seven silicon detectors.          
 61CA6c  The |g-ray spectra were also measured                                  
 61CA7c  for identified particles via isomer tagging technique using            
 61CA8c  a HPGe detector.                                                       
